cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models, please cite both the dataset and the associated article."
title: "Public Works Macroprocess — BPMN models (AS-IS and TO-BE)"
abstract: >-
  Complete BPMN 2.0 process models of the macroprocess governing the contracting
  and monitoring of educational public works between the Brazilian National Fund
  for Education Development (FNDE) and municipalities. Includes the empirically
  reconstructed current-state (AS-IS) macroprocess and a normative redesign
  (TO-BE) integrating ISO 19650 information management requirements with the
  procedures mandated by Public Procurement Law No. 14,133/2021. Models are
  provided in English and Portuguese, in BPMN 2.0 XML (ISO 19510), native Bizagi
  format and interactive HTML viewer.
